<%- include('partials/header') %>

<header class="page-intro">
  <p class="eyebrow">Visitor information</p>
  <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>

  <p class="page-intro__text">
    Find quick answers to common questions about visiting Aquarium World.
  </p>
</header>

<section class="faq-list" aria-label="Frequently asked questions">

  <article class="faq-item">
    <h2>What are the opening times?</h2>
    <p>Open every day, 9am–6pm.</p>
  </article>

  <article class="faq-item">
    <h2>What can I explore at Aquarium World?</h2>
    <p>
      Aquarium World includes themed zones, exhibits and interactive
      experiences focused on marine life and conservation.
    </p>
  </article>

  <article class="faq-item">
    <h2>Is Aquarium World suitable for families?</h2>
    <p>
      Yes. The website and aquarium experiences are designed to be
      welcoming and educational for families and general visitors.
    </p>
  </article>

  <article class="faq-item">
    <h2>How can I contact Aquarium World?</h2>
    <p>You can use the Contact page to send us a message.</p>
  </article>

</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>